            "detailed_description": "<strong>Asemblance is a single-player, first-person, psychological thriller.</strong><br><br>You wake to find yourself trapped inside an experimental machine...<br>A machine built to simulate memories.<br>You no longer recall why you entered, but an AI voice guides you.<br>Trying to escape, you face memories from a past you may not want to remember.<br>But what is real?<br>Are these memories your own?<br>Can you even trust your own mind anymore?<br>Are you even in control?<br><br>Asemblance is the pilot episode of a mind-bending franchise inspired by The Twilight<br>Zone, The X-Files, and the Black Mirror television series.<br><br>Soundtrack by Seattle electronic artists Kid Smpl and Johnny Goss.",
